#, no-wrap
msgid "The analysis is the same as for the small-scale example. Postselect each mode, print the table, and compare the Hamming-weight distribution and the two observables with the expected values for $n = 10$.\n"
msgstr "Pareho ang analysis sa maliit na halimbawa. I-postselect ang bawat mode, i-print ang table, at ihambing ang Hamming-weight distribution at ang dalawang observable sa mga inaasahang value para sa $n = 10$.\n"

